  "rulesText": "A class is a role-based archetype that determines a PC’s:\n\n- **Access to Domains:** Each class grants access to two domains; players choose cards from these domains during character creation and when leveling up.\n- Starting Evasion and Hit Points (HP)\n- Starting Items\n- Class Feature(s)\n- Class Hope Feature, a class feature that costs 3 Hope to activate.\n\nPlease note that the Daggerheart Core Set includes only the following nine classes: Bard, Druid, Guardian, Ranger, Rogue, Seraph, Sorcerer, Warrior, and Wizard.",
